alta: optional placement of intermediate tensors in the A311D NPU's AXI SRAM
Opt-in with ETNA_ML_AXI_SRAM=<max tensors>|all; needs the etnaviv build from patches/etnaviv-axi-sram with axi_sram=1.
Base: Mesa c5423d3e273. Local experiment, not for upstream as it stands.

